      { "sa": "tathā", "en": "so also" },
      { "sa": "aham", "en": "I" }
    ],
    "translation": "Having seen your great form, O mighty-armed one, with many mouths and eyes, with many arms, thighs and feet, with many bellies, fearsome with many tusks, the worlds are shaken, and so also am I."
  },
  "24": {
    "words": [
