      { "sa": "viṣṇo", "en": "O Viṣṇu" }
    ],
    "translation": "Having indeed seen you touching the sky, blazing, of many colours, with mouths opened wide, with blazing wide eyes, I, with inner self shaken, do not find steadiness and calm, O Viṣṇu."
  },
  "25": {
    "words": [
