      { "sa": "viṣṇo", "en": "O Viṣṇu" }
    ],
    "translation": "You lick again and again, swallowing the whole worlds from every side with flaming mouths. Having filled the whole world with radiance, your fierce rays scorch, O Viṣṇu."
  },
  "31": {
    "words": [
      { "sa": "ākhyāhi", "en": "tell" },
      { "sa": "me", "en": "to me" },
